Build OpenTUI with the Zig release available in the ports tree.

OpenTUI 0.9.9 requires exactly Zig 0.17.1, but ports ships Zig 0.17.0.  The
0.17.1 tree only contains patch-level fixes; the 0.9.9 source builds unchanged
with 0.17.0.  Lower the minimum and the exact-version check so the native core
can be built with the tree's Zig.

--- packages/native/build.zig.zon.orig
+++ packages/native/build.zig.zon
@@ -2,7 +2,7 @@
     .name = .opentui,
     .version = "0.9.9",
     .fingerprint = 0x5445027d063f5083,
-    .minimum_zig_version = "0.17.1",
+    .minimum_zig_version = "0.17.0",
     .dependencies = .{
         .uucode = .{
             .path = "zig-deps/uucode-opentui",
